The normalized data files in this directory are derived from public records of
the House of Councillors (参議院), the House of Representatives (衆議院) and the
National Diet Library (国立国会図書館) of Japan, and are published under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: 議員レコード (gikailog), with a link to the original source record.
